evidence establishes comment resolution, statistical adoption, or protocol approval [chronicle memory]\n4269:- extensions/chronicle/resources/2026-07-28T02-43-00-umNY-10min-memory-summary.md (cwd=/Users/smkzw/Documents/康哲项目资料/CMS-D017, rollout_path=/Users/smkzw/.codex/memories/extensions/chronicle/resources/2026-07-28T02-43-00-umNY-10min-memory-summary.md, updated_at=2026-07-28T02:43:00+00:00, thread_id=None, CMS-D017-PNH synopsis WPS comments) [chronicle memory]\n4275:- MG-K10-SAR-001-Ⅲ期-CSR-1.0-clean, 11.4.1 疗效分析, rTNSS, WOCF, LOCF, therapy strategy, LSMean, SAP 正文 4.1, TFLs-表 14.2.1.3, CMS-D017-PNH-方案摘要_v1.0_tracker.docx, FAS, PPS, SS, PKCS, AESI, ALT, estimand\n4292:- July 28 Word review showed MG-K10 section `11.4.1 疗效分析`, including week-2 rTNSS sensitivity analyses (WOCF/LOCF and treatment-policy handling) and SAP/TFL/table cross-references. For CMS-D017-PNH, WPS comments concerned phase-II design, analysis sets, efficacy-versus-PD classification, and potential central-lab/method-development handling. These are routing anchors, not approved clinical/statistical conclusions. [Task 4] [chronicle memory]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
