for repeated measures (MMRM) with the fixed categorical effect of visit, fixed continuous effect of the LDH baseline value as covariates, and participant as random effect.\",\"populationDescription\":\"FAS included all enrolled participants who received at least 1 dose (full or partial) of the study intervention. 'Overall number of participants analyzed' = participants evaluable for this outcome measure.\",\"reportingStatus\":\"POSTED\",\"paramType\":\"LEAST_SQUARES_MEAN\",\"dispersionType\":\"95% Confidence Interval\",\"unitOfMeasure\":\"percent change\",\"timeFrame\":\"Baseline, Day 183 (Week 26)\",\"groups\":[{\"id\":\"OG000\",\"title\":\"Ravulizumab\",\"description\":\"Participants received a weight-based loading dose of ravulizumab on Day 1 followed by weight-based maintenance dose of ravulizumab on Day 15 and once every 8 weeks (q8w) thereafter for a total of 26 weeks in Primary Treatment Period.\"}],\"denoms\":[{\"units\":\"Participants\",\"counts\":[{\"groupId\":\"OG000\",\"value\":\"17\"}]}],\"classes\":[{\"categories\":[{\"measurements\":[{\"groupId\":\"OG000\",\"value\":\"-81.3\",\"lowerLimit\":\"-84.2\",\"upperLimit\":\"-78.3\"}]}]}],\"analyses\":[{\"groupIds\":[\"OG000\"],\"nonInferiorityType\":\"OTHER\",\"pValue\":\"< 0.001\",\"statisticalMethod\":\"Mixed Models Analysis\"}]},{\"type\":\"SECONDARY\",\"title\":\"Percentage of Participants Achieving LDH <1.5 * Upper Limit of Normal (ULN) at Day 183 (Week 26)\",\"description\":\"LDH is an indicator of intravascular hemolysis that occurs in participants with paroxysmal nocturnal hemoglobinuria. A decrease in LDH indicated reduction (improvement) in hemolysis. Baseline was defined as the average of all available on-study assessments prior to the first dose of study drug.\",\"populationDescription\":\"FAS included all enrolled participants who received at least 1 dose (full or partial) of the study intervention. 'Overall number of participants analyzed' = participants evaluable for this outcome measure.\",\"